WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.090
In our region of the Amazon, no one's ever been attacked by a jaguar.

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:04.450
There's one old old...

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:08.210
This was twenty years ago, one old jag, you know, their teeth go.

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:10.210
The... With big cats, they usually...

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.490
The first thing is their teeth.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:17.665
And one old jag attacked like an old farmer.

00:00:18.225 --> 00:00:19.025
Attacked an old man.

00:00:19.025 --> 00:00:22.145
His his wife defended him with a shovel, and they ended up shooting the jaguar.

00:00:22.145 --> 00:00:26.465
But it was such a feeble old jaguar that said the only thing I can go after is a human.

00:00:26.465 --> 00:00:26.500
Right.

